513 0 obj
<<
/A 1476 0 R
/Alt (A conceptual diagram within a rounded rectangle presents four main themes and a central element, connected by arrows. At the top, text reads Navigating a contested clinical field with subtext uncertainty, competing narratives, legitimacy. Below this, three rectangular boxes are arranged horizontally. The leftmost box contains Meeting patients in no mans land. The middle box contains Offering a new explanatory map. The rightmost box contains Navigating by the map supporting change in practice. A central oval element between the middle and right boxes contains Embodied experience of change. A large rectangular box at the bottom contains Therapeutic relationship characterised by trust with subtext Validation of symptoms and suffering, collaboration, openness to new understandings. Bidirectional arrows connect the bottom box to the leftmost and middle boxes. A curved arrow points from the middle box to the rightmost box. A curved arrow points from the rightmost box to the central oval. A curved arrow points from the central oval to the bottom box. A curved arrow points from the bottom box to the rightmost box, with text Strengthening trust, confidence and agency adjacent to it. )
/K 10
/P 32 0 R
/Pg 19 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
